OL,3,AJimmy McGovern claims young offender
OL,4,Ainstitution staff 'lazy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe told BBC North West Tonight those in
OL,7,Fyoung offender institutions (YOIs) were
OL,8,F"banged up 23 hours a day" as part of a
OL,9,Fpolicy to stop offenders mixing, which
OL,10,Fgave officers an "excuse for being
OL,11,Flazy".
OL,13,FThe Prison Officers' Association (POA)
OL,14,Fsaid that criticism was "unfair" to
OL,15,Fcall officers lazy - and the policy was
OL,16,Fessential due to a daily threat of
OL,17,Fserious violence.
